SUMMARY:Camp Cris Dobbins 2027 – Week 1
LOCATION:Camp Cris Dobbins\, Elbert\, Colorado
DESCRIPTION:Scouting Colorado\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/061-CampCr
 isDobbins2027\n\n\n\nYour Scouting Colorado Summer Adventure!\nAdventure 
 awaits at Camp Cris Dobbins at McNeil Scout Ranch\, where Scouts can spen
 d a week immersed in the beauty of Colorado while choosing from a wide va
 riety of merit badges\, rank advancement programs\, outdoor skills\, STEM
 \, range and target activities\, aquatics\, and leadership opportunities.
  From Eagle-required badges and hands-on exploration to exciting experien
 ces like whitewater rafting on the Arkansas River\, Camp Cris Dobbins com
 bines unforgettable
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/061-CampCrisDobbins2027
END:VEVENT
